  "overview": [
   {
    "sourceId": "ar-2026",
    "page": 12,
    "excerpt": "Trent is one of the leading players in the branded lifestyle space in India. Our differentiated brands, that bring quality, affordability, and an enhanced customer experience, enable us to cater to a diverse and evolving consumer base across markets. Our key fashion brand concepts - Westside, Zudio, Samoh, and Burnt Toast - are each defined by a distinct identity and a clear consumer proposition.",
    "section": "Corporate overview"
   },
   {
    "sourceId": "ar-2026",
    "page": 126,
    "excerpt": "It is engaged in providing business support and outsourcing services relating to accounting, merchandising, human resources, payroll, sourcing, warehousing, distribution, etc., to Trent and associated businesses. Trent MAS Fashion Private Limited (TMF) Trent MAS Fashion Private Limited (TMF) was incorporated in 2023 as a 50:50 Joint Venture between the Company and MAS Amity Pte. Ltd.",
    "section": "Corporate overview"
   },
   {
    "sourceId": "ar-2026",
    "page": 77,
    "excerpt": "Strategic Roadmap At Trent, we are building a portfolio of distinctive own brands that deliver relevant fashion and lifestyle experiences at scale. Through an expanding omni-channel presence, consistent brand experience, and compelling value, we drive customer loyalty.",
    "section": "Corporate overview"
   }
